  "duration_s": 407.185011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "北京一位八十二岁的老人走了，人们在整理他的遗物时，心里很不是滋味，老人没有自己的房子，没有婚姻，没有儿女，攒了一辈子的积蓄，只有三万块钱，而这点钱，他也早立下遗嘱，全捐了出去。您说一个人活到八十二岁，一辈子就攒下三万块，还全捐了。他这辈子是不是是太亏了？可他有个名字叫万英之母，她叫林巧智，中国妇产科学的奠基人，中国科学院第一位女院士。她这一辈子亲手接生了五万多个，新生儿五万多个，您住那小区可能都没这么多人，她接生过谁？袁隆平，一九三零年，协和医院的出生档案里，接生医生一男写着调机，令，钟南山院士见了他得规规矩矩喊一声姑婆。您想啊，一个一无所有的女人，却有五万多个孩子，管他叫妈，他不是没机会过上好日子。他这一辈子有三次天大的机会摆在面前，他全扔了。第一次一九三九年，他去美国芝加哥大学进修美国的顶级医院抢着留下，他条件也开的特别高。进修结束，他撂下一句话，科学可以没有国界，医生不能没有祖国收拾箱子回到祖国。第二次一九四九年解放前夕，傅作义将军的夫人给他送来一张亲笔签名的机票，拿着他能上任何一架飞机去任何一个城市生活，多少人用金条都换不来的福利待遇，他却谢绝了。我的病人还在这儿，我哪儿也不去。第三次正值开国大典，他收到红底金字的官礼邀请函，多少人挤破脑袋都去不了。他看了一眼，搁在桌上进了产房，有人追着问，这么大的喜事，您怎么不去，她头也没回。我是大夫，产房里有产妇等着，您说这女人是不是傻？别人拼命想抓住的东西，她一样一样往外扔，可她心里那杆秤，从来没歪过她为什么学医？五岁那年，母亲病逝，却跪在床边，眼睁睁看着妈妈闭上眼睛，哭得撕心裂肺，却什么都做不了。从那天起，他就发誓我要当医生，我要让别人的妈不再死。他这一辈子把别人的妈和别人的孩子看得比自己的命还重，给孕妇听。胎心前，她总先把冰凉的听诊器贴在自己手，心里捂热。孕妇已经在受罪了，能少一点粮就少一点粮。产妇疼的喊破嗓子，别的医生手足无措。她走过去，摸摸头，摸摸手，产妇立马就安静了，有人托关系，想让他给领导插个队。他一句话怼回去，我这里没有什么特殊的病人，医生面前人人平等。一九四一年，太平洋战争爆发，协和医院关了门。他就在东堂子胡同开了间小诊所，穷人来看病，他不但不收钱，还从自己积蓄里往外逃，给产妇买鸡蛋、买红糖。兵荒马乱的年月，他心里只有一个念头，大人孩子能活下来，比什么都强。一九六二年，一个新生儿全身发黄，国内从没治过这种病，家属都快放弃了。同事劝他别结他，转头去翻遍外文资料，找到脐带换血的办法，一次次失败，一次次重来，直到孩子哭出第一声。那是中国第一例被救回来的新生儿溶血症患儿，他守的从来不是名声使命。一九八三年他走了，弥留之际，他嘴里断断续续喊的是快快拿产钱来，这是他留给这个世界的最后一句话。他留下遗嘱三万元积蓄，全部捐给幼儿园。托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究，骨灰洒回故乡。鼓浪屿的海面，他走了，什么都没带走房，没有钱，没有孩子没有，可您数数，他留下了什么？五万多个孩子，五万多个家庭的圆满，还有千千万万中国人欠他的一声，谢谢您说他这辈子还不值，有人人用钱衡量一辈子，有人用房衡量一辈子。而他呢他用五万多个新生儿的鲜活生命衡量了自己的一生。人这一辈子，到底图什么？不是图有多少房，多少钱，多少名声，是图到死那天，心里还惦记着别人，还放不下手里的活。他临走前惦记的是产前，是产妇，是那些还没出生的小生命，这样的人才叫真正的不虚此生。林巧智是我们国之脊梁系列中的其中一位，可国之脊梁却不止这一位。钱学森、袁隆平、邓稼先等等，下一个您想听谁？评论区告诉我，如果这段历史故事触动到了您，点亮红心，收藏起来，转发给更多人，让这些把医生都献给中国发展建设事业的人，被更多中国人记住，关注我国之脊梁的故事。咱们接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 2910,
      "text": "北京一位八十二岁的老人走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3570,
      "end_ms": 5490,
      "text": "人们在整理他的遗物时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5710,
      "end_ms": 7230,
      "text": "心里很不是滋味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7750,
      "end_ms": 9550,
      "text": "老人没有自己的房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9970,
      "end_ms": 10930,
      "text": "没有婚姻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11190,
      "end_ms": 12070,
      "text": "没有儿女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12590,
      "end_ms": 14410,
      "text": "攒了一辈子的积蓄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14690,
      "end_ms": 15950,
      "text": "只有三万块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16309,
      "end_ms": 17390,
      "text": "而这点钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17770,
      "end_ms": 19670,
      "text": "他也早立下遗嘱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20050,
      "end_ms": 21170,
      "text": "全捐了出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21730,
      "end_ms": 24290,
      "text": "您说一个人活到八十二岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24630,
      "end_ms": 26510,
      "text": "一辈子就攒下三万块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27090,
      "end_ms": 28230,
      "text": "还全捐了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28530,
      "end_ms": 31020,
      "text": "他这辈子是不是是太亏了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31760,
      "end_ms": 34720,
      "text": "可他有个名字叫万英之母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35140,
      "end_ms": 36760,
      "text": "她叫林巧智，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36900,
      "end_ms": 39140,
      "text": "中国妇产科学的奠基人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39620,
      "end_ms": 41960,
      "text": "中国科学院第一位女院士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 42380,
      "end_ms": 46040,
      "text": "她这一辈子亲手接生了五万多个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 46040,
      "end_ms": 48180,
      "text": "新生儿五万多个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 48340,
      "end_ms": 51240,
      "text": "您住那小区可能都没这么多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 52080,
      "end_ms": 53200,
      "text": "她接生过谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 53500,
      "end_ms": 54100,
      "text": "袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 54760,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "一九三零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 56160,
      "end_ms": 58240,
      "text": "协和医院的出生档案里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 58560,
      "end_ms": 61660,
      "text": "接生医生一男写着调机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 61720,
      "end_ms": 61960,
      "text": "令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 62240,
      "end_ms": 67245,
      "text": "钟南山院士见了他得规规矩矩喊一声姑婆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67870,
      "end_ms": 68515,
      "text": "您想啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 68900,
      "end_ms": 70680,
      "text": "一个一无所有的女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70860,
      "end_ms": 72735,
      "text": "却有五万多个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 73670,
      "end_ms": 74565,
      "text": "管他叫妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 75380,
      "end_ms": 77925,
      "text": "他不是没机会过上好日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 78670,
      "end_ms": 84065,
      "text": "他这一辈子有三次天大的机会摆在面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 84280,
      "end_ms": 85145,
      "text": "他全扔了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 86670,
      "end_ms": 88785,
      "text": "第一次一九三九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 89070,
      "end_ms": 93980,
      "text": "他去美国芝加哥大学进修美国的顶级医院抢着留下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 93980,
      "end_ms": 96055,
      "text": "他条件也开的特别高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 96640,
      "end_ms": 97560,
      "text": "进修结束，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 97720,
      "end_ms": 98895,
      "text": "他撂下一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 99260,
      "end_ms": 100885,
      "text": "科学可以没有国界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 101510,
      "end_ms": 106355,
      "text": "医生不能没有祖国收拾箱子回到祖国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107120,
      "end_ms": 110050,
      "text": "第二次一九四九年解放前夕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 110230,
      "end_ms": 114245,
      "text": "傅作义将军的夫人给他送来一张亲笔签名的机票，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 114860,
      "end_ms": 119425,
      "text": "拿着他能上任何一架飞机去任何一个城市生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 120230,
      "end_ms": 123150,
      "text": "多少人用金条都换不来的福利待遇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 123570,
      "end_ms": 124650,
      "text": "他却谢绝了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 126090,
      "end_ms": 127590,
      "text": "我的病人还在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 128590,
      "end_ms": 129550,
      "text": "我哪儿也不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 130710,
      "end_ms": 134230,
      "text": "第三次正值开国大典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 135250,
      "end_ms": 138170,
      "text": "他收到红底金字的官礼邀请函，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 139350,
      "end_ms": 141770,
      "text": "多少人挤破脑袋都去不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 142310,
      "end_ms": 143210,
      "text": "他看了一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 143410,
      "end_ms": 145230,
      "text": "搁在桌上进了产房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 145830,
      "end_ms": 146850,
      "text": "有人追着问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 147170,
      "end_ms": 148410,
      "text": "这么大的喜事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 148570,
      "end_ms": 149635,
      "text": "您怎么不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 150060,
      "end_ms": 151060,
      "text": "她头也没回。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 151500,
      "end_ms": 152380,
      "text": "我是大夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 152840,
      "end_ms": 154420,
      "text": "产房里有产妇等着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 154660,
      "end_ms": 156700,
      "text": "您说这女人是不是傻？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 157420,
      "end_ms": 159500,
      "text": "别人拼命想抓住的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 159680,
      "end_ms": 161360,
      "text": "她一样一样往外扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 161900,
      "end_ms": 163220,
      "text": "可她心里那杆秤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 163560,
      "end_ms": 166440,
      "text": "从来没歪过她为什么学医？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 167380,
      "end_ms": 168300,
      "text": "五岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 168660,
      "end_ms": 169680,
      "text": "母亲病逝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 170480,
      "end_ms": 171660,
      "text": "却跪在床边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 172280,
      "end_ms": 175240,
      "text": "眼睁睁看着妈妈闭上眼睛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 176200,
      "end_ms": 177820,
      "text": "哭得撕心裂肺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 178300,
      "end_ms": 179705,
      "text": "却什么都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 180620,
      "end_ms": 181520,
      "text": "从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 181520,
      "end_ms": 184440,
      "text": "他就发誓我要当医生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 185180,
      "end_ms": 189060,
      "text": "我要让别人的妈不再死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 189260,
      "end_ms": 194860,
      "text": "他这一辈子把别人的妈和别人的孩子看得比自己的命还重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 195740,
      "end_ms": 196660,
      "text": "给孕妇听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 196740,
      "end_ms": 197380,
      "text": "胎心前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 197800,
      "end_ms": 201140,
      "text": "她总先把冰凉的听诊器贴在自己手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 201140,
      "end_ms": 201920,
      "text": "心里捂热。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 202600,
      "end_ms": 204200,
      "text": "孕妇已经在受罪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 204620,
      "end_ms": 207060,
      "text": "能少一点粮就少一点粮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 207700,
      "end_ms": 209400,
      "text": "产妇疼的喊破嗓子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 209920,
      "end_ms": 211630,
      "text": "别的医生手足无措。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 212450,
      "end_ms": 213250,
      "text": "她走过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 213550,
      "end_ms": 214150,
      "text": "摸摸头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 214390,
      "end_ms": 215050,
      "text": "摸摸手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 215850,
      "end_ms": 217510,
      "text": "产妇立马就安静了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 217890,
      "end_ms": 219070,
      "text": "有人托关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 219510,
      "end_ms": 221210,
      "text": "想让他给领导插个队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 221530,
      "end_ms": 223130,
      "text": "他一句话怼回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 225010,
      "end_ms": 227190,
      "text": "我这里没有什么特殊的病人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 227550,
      "end_ms": 229890,
      "text": "医生面前人人平等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 230190,
      "end_ms": 231210,
      "text": "一九四一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 231250,
      "end_ms": 232710,
      "text": "太平洋战争爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 233130,
      "end_ms": 234370,
      "text": "协和医院关了门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 235030,
      "end_ms": 237670,
      "text": "他就在东堂子胡同开了间小诊所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 238110,
      "end_ms": 239110,
      "text": "穷人来看病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 239290,
      "end_ms": 240645,
      "text": "他不但不收钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 240920,
      "end_ms": 243055,
      "text": "还从自己积蓄里往外逃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 243490,
      "end_ms": 245955,
      "text": "给产妇买鸡蛋、买红糖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 246750,
      "end_ms": 248170,
      "text": "兵荒马乱的年月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 248430,
      "end_ms": 250135,
      "text": "他心里只有一个念头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 250620,
      "end_ms": 252325,
      "text": "大人孩子能活下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 252870,
      "end_ms": 253925,
      "text": "比什么都强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 254690,
      "end_ms": 255675,
      "text": "一九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 255990,
      "end_ms": 257915,
      "text": "一个新生儿全身发黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 258290,
      "end_ms": 260070,
      "text": "国内从没治过这种病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 260090,
      "end_ms": 261605,
      "text": "家属都快放弃了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 262340,
      "end_ms": 264680,
      "text": "同事劝他别结他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 264680,
      "end_ms": 268505,
      "text": "转头去翻遍外文资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 269100,
      "end_ms": 271485,
      "text": "找到脐带换血的办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 272230,
      "end_ms": 273435,
      "text": "一次次失败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 273950,
      "end_ms": 275205,
      "text": "一次次重来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 276040,
      "end_ms": 277895,
      "text": "直到孩子哭出第一声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 278530,
      "end_ms": 282685,
      "text": "那是中国第一例被救回来的新生儿溶血症患儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 283500,
      "end_ms": 286660,
      "text": "他守的从来不是名声使命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 287650,
      "end_ms": 289435,
      "text": "一九八三年他走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 290520,
      "end_ms": 291485,
      "text": "弥留之际，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 292230,
      "end_ms": 296525,
      "text": "他嘴里断断续续喊的是快快拿产钱来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 296930,
      "end_ms": 299385,
      "text": "这是他留给这个世界的最后一句话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 299810,
      "end_ms": 302125,
      "text": "他留下遗嘱三万元积蓄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 302640,
      "end_ms": 304175,
      "text": "全部捐给幼儿园。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 305180,
      "end_ms": 308620,
      "text": "托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 309680,
      "end_ms": 311500,
      "text": "骨灰洒回故乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 311540,
      "end_ms": 312640,
      "text": "鼓浪屿的海面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 313560,
      "end_ms": 314240,
      "text": "他走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 315760,
      "end_ms": 317420,
      "text": "什么都没带走房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 317700,
      "end_ms": 319620,
      "text": "没有钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 319720,
      "end_ms": 321440,
      "text": "没有孩子没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 321860,
      "end_ms": 322760,
      "text": "可您数数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 322780,
      "end_ms": 323880,
      "text": "他留下了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 324060,
      "end_ms": 325260,
      "text": "五万多个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 325420,
      "end_ms": 327000,
      "text": "五万多个家庭的圆满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 327320,
      "end_ms": 329980,
      "text": "还有千千万万中国人欠他的一声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 329980,
      "end_ms": 334240,
      "text": "谢谢您说他这辈子还不值，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 334540,
      "end_ms": 336650,
      "text": "有人人用钱衡量一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 336830,
      "end_ms": 338810,
      "text": "有人用房衡量一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 338870,
      "end_ms": 344670,
      "text": "而他呢他用五万多个新生儿的鲜活生命衡量了自己的一生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 345310,
      "end_ms": 346410,
      "text": "人这一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 346650,
      "end_ms": 347670,
      "text": "到底图什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 347870,
      "end_ms": 349390,
      "text": "不是图有多少房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 349670,
      "end_ms": 350350,
      "text": "多少钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 350770,
      "end_ms": 351730,
      "text": "多少名声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 352270,
      "end_ms": 353710,
      "text": "是图到死那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 354210,
      "end_ms": 355870,
      "text": "心里还惦记着别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 356170,
      "end_ms": 357590,
      "text": "还放不下手里的活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00148",
      "start_ms": 358210,
      "end_ms": 360770,
      "text": "他临走前惦记的是产前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00149",
      "start_ms": 361270,
      "end_ms": 362030,
      "text": "是产妇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00150",
      "start_ms": 362490,
      "end_ms": 364575,
      "text": "是那些还没出生的小生命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00151",
      "start_ms": 365210,
      "end_ms": 369225,
      "text": "这样的人才叫真正的不虚此生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00152",
      "start_ms": 369500,
      "end_ms": 374540,
      "text": "林巧智是我们国之脊梁系列中的其中一位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00153",
      "start_ms": 374640,
      "end_ms": 377485,
      "text": "可国之脊梁却不止这一位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00154",
      "start_ms": 378470,
      "end_ms": 382045,
      "text": "钱学森、袁隆平、邓稼先等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00155",
      "start_ms": 382350,
      "end_ms": 385015,
      "text": "下一个您想听谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00156",
      "start_ms": 385350,
      "end_ms": 386375,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00157",
      "start_ms": 386830,
      "end_ms": 389205,
      "text": "如果这段历史故事触动到了您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00158",
      "start_ms": 389760,
      "end_ms": 391005,
      "text": "点亮红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00159",
      "start_ms": 391440,
      "end_ms": 392345,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00160",
      "start_ms": 392670,
      "end_ms": 393985,
      "text": "转发给更多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00161",
      "start_ms": 394710,
      "end_ms": 399165,
      "text": "让这些把医生都献给中国发展建设事业的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00162",
      "start_ms": 399530,
      "end_ms": 401305,
      "text": "被更多中国人记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00163",
      "start_ms": 402560,
      "end_ms": 405875,
      "text": "关注我国之脊梁的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_98f5df8545bbe3b4_s00164",
      "start_ms": 406400,
      "end_ms": 407095,
      "text": "咱们接着讲。"
    }
  ],
